/// A real, logged-in user's rating (+ optional text comment) on one GameMod.
/// One row per (userId, gameModId) — submitting again edits the same row
/// rather than creating a second one, which is also what makes the average
/// and the comment list agree with each other (both are just reads over this
/// one table). Deliberately not a fork of the admin-only `Review` model above
/// (curated homepage testimonials, no userId, approved/featured workflow) —
/// this is customer-authored, unmoderated-by-default, per-mod feedback.
